David chot 27/08 (D-076 + de xuat the he). The he 0 giu dung ba con so da chot:
  A1Gen 0 · A1ID 999999999 · A1Name 9chain-a1-g0 · chainId me 9000000009
  khoi chainId L1: 9000000010-9000999999
Bang mang TAP: A1IDTap = 899999999 - A1Gen, ten 9chain-a1-tap-g0.

VI SAO PHAI CO THE HE, khong chi doi 9001 -> 999999999 mot lan:
bat tay P2P so DUY NHAT networkID (peer.go:825; tu "genesis" xuat hien 0 lan trong ca
tep do). Neu the he sau CUNG lay 999999999 thi lo do quay lai nguyen ven, va luc do te
hon — 9001 la "trung do khong ai chon", con luc do la "trung do ta da chon va da ghi".

BA CHO PHAI KIEM THEO DAI, va chung nam o ba goi khong import duoc nhau:
  genesis/params.go   tham so kinh te
  config/config.go    node lap cau hinh staking + phi   (x2 cho)
  upgrade/upgrade.go  lich nang cap — goi nay KHONG import duoc genesis
=> dat constants.LaMangA1 o `constants` cho ca ba dung chung.

🔴 BAI HOC DAT NHAT CUA LUOT NAY — cong xanh ma node van sai:
netgen da co cong kiem bo dinh danh (identity.go), cong do XANH, va
GetStakingConfig(899999999) tra dung 7.900.000.001. Nhung node khoi dong lai log
supplyCap = 720000000000000000 (LocalParams, tran 720 TRIEU) — vi config/config.go lap
cau hinh bang DUONG KHAC voi thu cong kiem. Cong kiem cai NETGEN thay; chi BOOT MOT NODE
THAT moi kiem duoc cai NODE thay.
Neu khong boot thu, ngay G se sinh mot mang phat hanh 4,3 ty chay tren tran 720 trieu =>
TRAN NGUOC uint64 khi phat thuong, lo ra nhieu ngay sau.

upgrade.go: `case constants.A1ID` -> kiem theo dai. Truoc do dung MOT networkID nhan lich
nang cap chu quyen, con bang mang tap va MOI THE HE SAU roi xuong Default cua Ava Labs —
D-049 bi vo hieu trong im lang.

genesis/genesis.go: khoa map bi danh tai san "AVAX" -> "LOVE9". Day la bi danh DUOC DANG KY
THAT tren X-Chain (vm.go RegisterAlias), khong phai nhan hien thi. Name/Symbol da la LOVE9
tu patch 0002 nhung khoa map thi chua — lop rebrand dung o cho nguoi NHIN thay, khong toi
cho may DOC. Nam trong byte genesis X-Chain => chi doi duoc o luot sinh lai.

netgen: cong `!= 9001` -> cong NAM-THU-PHAI-KHOP (identity.go): A1Gen / networkID / ten /
co mat trong NetworkIDToHRP / khoi chainId. Va compose thoi cam cung --network-id=9001
(no lam node tu choi khoi dong khi genesis mang so khac — loi hien, nhung phoi ra rang
netgen tung co HAI nguon su that cho cung mot con so).

NGHIEM THU — mang tap 3 node THAT (a1tap, networkID 899999999):
  networkID 899999999 · networkName 9chain-a1-tap-g0 · eth_chainId 9000000909
  supplyCap 7900000001000000000 · numPeers 2 · 0 ERROR
  X-Chain: avm.getAssetDescription{assetID:"LOVE9"} tra ve dung => alias da vao chain that
  DB path: /root/.avalanchego/db/9chain-a1-g0 => the he da vao duong dan DB

🔴 BAI CAT-KET-NOI, kem DOI CHUNG DUONG:
  ke xam nhap  networkID 999999999 (lech bang) -> numPeers 0   BI CAT
  doi chung    networkID 899999999 (khop)      -> numPeers 3   VAO DUOC LUOI
  log: peer.go:826 malformed message {"field":"networkID","peerNetworkID":899999999,
       "ourNetworkID":999999999}
Khong co doi chung duong thi "numPeers 0" khong phan biet duoc voi "node hong".

Cong netgen doi chung nguoc 3 ca: bang tap di qua · 999999998 (so cua the he sau) bi chan
kem dung canh bao HRP · 9001 cu bi tu choi.

